    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Remove 'Error API' feature from CredentialsContainer.get]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27735</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27735"/>
        <updated>2025-09-02T14:19:37.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">This was added in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2053988774" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/21721" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/21721/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/21721">#21721</a></p>
<blockquote>
<p dir="auto">The Error API, which mainly manifests as useful properties of the return error object when a FedCM get() call rejects.</p>
</blockquote>
<p dir="auto">What the FedCM Error API really is, though, is <code class="notranslate">IdentityCredentialError</code> and we already have compat data for that.</p>
<p dir="auto">Remove this entry is it only appears without further explanation on <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CredentialsContainer/get#browser_compatibility" rel="nofollow">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CredentialsContainer/get#browser_compatibility</a>. It's not even in web-features yet, either.</p>
<p dir="auto">I'm creating MDN docs for <code class="notranslate">IdentityCredentialError</code> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3376224258" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40986" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/40986/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40986">mdn/content#40986</a>.</p>]]></content>
        <author>
            <name>Elchi3</name>
            <email>Elchi3@noreply.github.com</email>
            <uri>https://github.com/Elchi3</uri>
        </author>
        <published>2025-09-02T14:18:53.000Z</published>
    </entry>
