<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Chrome 139 adds support for 3D textures using BC and ASTC compressed formats. See <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5080855386783744" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5080855386783744</a>, and also see <a href="https://developer.chrome.com/blog/new-in-webgpu-139#3d_texture_support_for_bc_and_astc_compressed_formats" rel="nofollow">https://developer.chrome.com/blog/new-in-webgpu-139#3d_texture_support_for_bc_and_astc_compressed_formats</a> for a bit more explanation.</p>
<p dir="auto">This PR adds a data point for the WebGPU <code class="notranslate">GPUSupportedFeatures</code> required to enable these texture usages.</p>

